  Level-2 Clusters:         131
  Missing Data Info:

                      Pattern #:       1     2     3     4
                          miss % --------------------------
                     pain =  1.3       -     -     M     M  
                    sleep =  1.3       -     -     M     M  
                      day =  0.0       -     -     -     -  
                pain.lag1 =  6.1       -     M     -     M  
               sleep.lag1 =  6.1       -     M     -     M  
                                 --------------------------
                                 %  93.2   5.5   0.7   0.6


MODEL INFORMATION:

  NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
    Outcome Models:         48
    Predictor Models:       0

  PREDICTORS
    Fixed variables:        day

  FACTORS
    Level-2:                b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j d_Sj d_Pj

  DEFINED VARIABLES
    [1]  sleep_resid_lag = sleep.lag - (b_0j + d_Sj*(day - 1)) 
    [2]  pain_resid_lag = pain.lag - (g_0j + d_Pj*(day - 1)) 

  MODELS

   between:
    [1]  b_0j ~ Intercept@b_0
    [2]  b_1j ~ Intercept@b_1
    [3]  b_2j ~ Intercept@b_2
    [4]  d_Pj ~ Intercept@d_p
    [5]  d_Sj ~ Intercept@d_s
    [6]  g_0j ~ Intercept@g_0
    [7]  g_1j ~ Intercept@g_1
    [8]  g_2j ~ Intercept@g_2
    [9]  b_0j b_1j b_2j d_Pj d_Sj g_0j g_1j g_2j <-> b_0j b_1j b_2j d_Pj d_Sj 
                 g_0j g_1j g_2j 

   within:
   [10]  pain ~ g_0j@1 day*d_Pj@1 (pain_resid_lag)*g_1j@1 (sleep_resid_lag)*g_2j@1
   [11]  sleep ~ b_0j@1 day*d_Sj@1 (sleep_resid_lag)*b_1j@1 (pain_resid_lag)*b_2j@1 
                 (sleep_resid_lag*pain_resid_lag)@b_3
   [12]  pain <-> sleep


